<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings raises Ahold EPS estimates.</title>
<headline>ING Barings raises Ahold EPS estimates.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sept 9 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Ahold	     Retailing	93.70  ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Reiterate BUY. Following bullish statements on U.S. ING has increased its EPS estimates slightly...implying EPS growth for 1996 of 13 pct and for 1997 of 24 pct. With estimated EPS growth of 15 pct in 1995-2000 period, Ahold belongs to the fastest growing companies in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	 3.74		 25.1     1.35</p>
<p>    1996		    4.26    4.18     22.0     1.53</p>
<p>    1997		    5.28    5.09     17.7     1.90</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
</text>
